  "title": "Dark mode",
  "description": "The BEST Dark Mode Resource Pack for Minecraft Java Edition.",
  "body": "\n![How the resource pack looks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/a62293e5fb27cf2c7d51cb4f1ff89ee62d8ca7ec.png)\n\n\n# Dark mode resource pack, the best one there is.\n\n **__Dark Mode__** gives the Minecraft GUI a **__darker look__** while maintaining the **__vanilla__** textures.\n\n\n## Mods supported\n \n| Mod                                                                                                                                                 | Supported         |                                                                 \n|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:---------------:|         \n|[ClothConfig](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config)                                                        | ✅                     | \n|[Mod menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu)                                                               | ✅                     | \n|[Request more mods!](https://github.com/Batmangy/Dark-mode/issues)                         |**<--- Request here!**                  |\n\n\n\n\n## Examples/Screenshots\n\n\n### Title screen\n\n![How the title screen looks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/3d0f3eb1abc81bb582ce5e2517cc45c33aaa5bd5.png)\n\n\n### Crafting table\n\n![How the crafting table looks (with a little bit of trolling)](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/67b9bbc7436c2b5f328600a419edc428d5fbe5a9.png)\n\n\n### Chest\n\n![How the chest looks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/f4da91eaf1391ddfed00ead5083ff5ee544399fa.png)\n\n### Furnace\n\n![How the furnace looks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/08aad74d8447b5c37dd9b55b90bf737bae483737.png)\n\n\n### Anvil\n\n![How the anvil looks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/e1857471cb87e8059dd3de7e341046def3c3d4b6.png)\n\n\n### Enchantment table \n\n![How the Enchantment table looks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/cdbf469a3cc45168ebd00067c23928fee2efc9d1.png)\n\n\n### Smithing table \n\n![How the smithing table looks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/86482da4a58dcf51f56c33eb15f90b8b066adab1.png)\n\n### Brewing stand \n\n![How the Brewing stand table looks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/3ca146399c8b4ddde7afc0bd4a7abf077b844a90.png)\n\n\n### Beacon\n\n![How the beacon looks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9wyd4FMB/images/fd77951b89a1e40eac940c98a74181c1161677a9.png)\n\n\n### **__Heavily inspired by Deafult Dark Mode.__**\nhttps://modrinth.com/resourcepack/default-dark-mode\n\n### **__Also inspired by Dark Mode.___**\nhttps://modrinth.com/resourcepack/darkmode",
